@jandockx - as building a document should be a one-time thing, and later we should serve a static generated file, it is not a critical step as such.

So it raises a question - why is the document generation needed? In case just "to not read the content from GitHub", I can point to "officially unofficial" output at https://asvs.dev/v5.0.draft/0x00-Header/

If something else, let us know.
